<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Bital raised to 'buy'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bital raised to 'buy'.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BBV LatInvest said on Tuesday it had upgraded Mexican financial services company Grupo Financiero Bital SA de CV to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot;.</p>
<p>The brokerage said the group was poised to experience a substantial earnings recovery due to renewed revenue growth, low-cost funding, controlled expenses and reduced provisions.</p>
<p>-- Ben Hirschler, London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
